# Fork branches merged onto upstream main for deployment (one per line).
# sonicroom-update prunes a line itself once its PR is merged or the branch
# is deleted; a conflicting unmerged branch is skipped with a WARNING.
#
# Order matters only in that a branch must not conflict with what is already
# merged above it. A branch that already contains the branches above it can go
# anywhere — the merge is then a no-op.

# Points the Windows client default ServerUrl at this instance instead of
# upstream sonic.gomsen.com (deployment-local; upstream would not take it).
fork/serrebi/windows-default-server
# Stereo downmix for audio-proxy transcodes (AC3 5.1 IPTV failed). Upstream PR #14.
fork/serrebi/opus-stereo-downmix

# Retry yt-dlp once and report its real error when audio-proxy extraction fails. Upstream PR #15; drop once merged
fork/serrebi/ytdlp-retry-diagnostics
# Pre-join mic slider usable with iOS VoiceOver. Upstream PR (ios-voiceover-sliders).
fork/serrebi/ios-voiceover-sliders
# Loudness boost mic option. Upstream PR (loudness-boost).
fork/serrebi/loudness-boost
# Voice processing on by default everywhere (laptop-mic feedback squeal). Upstream PR (voice-processing-default-on).
fork/serrebi/voice-processing-default-on

# Mic feedback-howl guard: notch the tone + duck + spoken hint. Upstream PR #19.
fork/serrebi/howl-suppressor

# Windows voice processing (AEC/NS/AGC) + media playback + web echo cancellation
# of system audio. Upstream PR #9. Merge of deploy done 2026-10-04 (fdf40cd), so
# this line and the seven overlay lines above all live in one branch head.
fork/serrebi-media-playback
# Electron voice-processing default + reservation-clock prune. Superset of the
# overlays; no upstream PR. Fixes server/src/reservations.ts + admin.ts clock.
fork/fixes/perm-default-and-reservation-clock